  target_c_integers.adam - adam cimport: the C library's integer typedefs (stddef.h's size_t / ptrdiff_t,
  stdint.h's uint64_t / int64_t / intptr_t / uint_fast32_t) as Adam's
  fixed-width integer of their size, in fields, routines and an inline
  body's conversions: one line for both targets (glibc says unsigned long,
  mingw-w64 unsigned long long); C's own long stays clong
  (PLAN-LINUX64 LX3d3c1; written by scripts\adam\gen_cimport_rows.py)
